2: .SYNOPSIS
3:     Sends a YAML request envelope through the PowerShell MCP runtime.
4: .DESCRIPTION
5:     Constructs a YAML envelope and routes it through the configured
6:     PowerShell MCP invocation path.
7: 
8:     Translation shim: workflow.sessionlog.* methods are not server routes
9:     — the dispatcher rejects them as method_not_found. They are plugin-
10:     local verbs that update cache/current-turn.yaml so the Stop hook can
