65: function Get-ReplCanonicalAgentName {
66:     # TR-MCP-REPL-011: map the resolved agent (which can fall back to lowercase 'default' or a
67:     # lowercase host key like 'claude-code') to a PascalCase source type so composed session ids
68:     # satisfy the server regex ^[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9]*-... (BUG-TRIAGE-085).
